# Ket thuc dong LF o ca hai phia — khong phai chuyen tham my.
#
# Co che dong bo cua hai he la "cung commit thi cung byte" (§3.3 spec.md). Mot
# ben chay Windows, mot ben chay Linux trong Docker; de git tu doi CRLF thi
# cung mot commit cho ra hai chuoi byte khac nhau tren hai may, va ca lap luan
# do sup. Ghim LF, khong de core.autocrlf quyet dinh.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Chuan vang: khong duoc dong vao mot byte nao. Dau ngoac kep la bat buoc —
# ten thu muc co dau cach.
"Bang mau/*.xml" -text

*.ts   binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.bin  binary
